{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109901933842747393"]}, "author_id": "1341576373672898561", "created_at": "2026-10-13T06:59:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109901943539949865"], "id": "2109901943539949865", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 3089, "like_count": 428, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 38}, "text": "This the Durga that will steal you heart— Ahiritola Sarbojonin. Will be open for Public 15th October (Evening onwards) https://t.co/EYtMJHNMjW", "url": "https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2109901943539949865"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109894554338131968", "3_2109894554312970240", "3_2109894554338119680", "3_2109894554279346176"]}, "author_id": "2035449334884610048", "created_at": "2026-10-13T06:30:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109894563951419404"], "id": "2109894563951419404", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "“Durga Puja 2026”\n\nExclusive First Look: \n\nRajdanga Naba Uday Sangha \nRajdanga Amra Kajan Kalyan Samity \nNalin Sarkar Street Sarbojanin\n\n#DurgaPuja2026 #Kolkata #Bengali https://t.co/YKZkpDZ7j4", "url": "https://x.com/subhankar_avi95/status/2109894563951419404"}, {"author_id": "1956172021399695360", "created_at": "2026-10-13T02:53:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109839923511799946"], "id": "2109839923511799946", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Shyambazar Metro থেকে Bagbazar Durga Puja 2026 কীভাবে যাবেন? | Durga Puj... https://t.co/efazV9xGrz via @YouTube", "url": "https://x.com/Aditya228377257/status/2109839923511799946"}, {"author_id": "1956172021399695360", "created_at": "2026-10-13T02:53:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109839902963802270"], "id": "2109839902963802270", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Kalighat Metro থেকে 66 Pally Durga Puja 2026 কীভাবে যাবেন?🚶Complete Guid... https://t.co/YefAgLpJdl via @YouTube", "url": "https://x.com/Aditya228377257/status/2109839902963802270"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109692868306853888"]}, "author_id": "1496031788170371074", "created_at": "2026-10-12T17:09:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109692879937650764"], "id": "2109692879937650764", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 217, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "This Pujo, the spirit of Shakti shines a little differently. 🧡\n\nAt College Square, VIDA’s removable batteries power an illuminated tribute to Maa Durga, celebrating the strength that inspires us to keep moving forward.\n\nCome experience Bengal’s #1 Shakti. ⚡️\n.\n.\n.\n[ VIDA, https://t.co/doqcNS1KpH", "url": "https://x.com/VidaDotWorld/status/2109692879937650764"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109579898503520256"]}, "author_id": "1425799761458728962", "created_at": "2026-10-12T12:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109622613878198348"], "id": "2109622613878198348", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 297, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "With ‘Souls of Fire’, 66 Pally is a remembrance of the young lives that were lost in Bengal’s struggle against colonial rule.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/iBCbieyrjD\n\n#66Pally #DurgaPujaTheme #Kolkata #MyKolkata\n\n[66 Pally, Durga Puja Theme, Indian Independence, Revolutionaries] https://t.co/8AeIrV9eT6", "url": "https://x.com/TT_My_Kolkata/status/2109622613878198348"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109541627866046464", "3_2109541643959611392", "3_2109541656513150976"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-12T07:08:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109541667170848837"], "id": "2109541667170848837", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 248, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📍 Nalin Sarkar Street Sarbojanin.\n\n🎨 Sanatan Dinda.\n\n👉 The pandal was fantastic too. But, oh boy, I bet that it's gonna be as iconic as 2011 &amp; 2025 works of Sanatan Dinda at this club! Take a bow, Sanatan Dinda!\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 2/2 https://t.co/GJTFcaDxwy", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109541667170848837"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109541556541857793", "3_2109541571574292480", "3_2109541591484694528", "3_2109541606890328064"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-12T07:08:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109541619070599222"], "id": "2109541619070599222", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 1416, "like_count": 86, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "📍 Nalin Sarkar Street Sarbojanin.\n\n🎨 Sanatan Dinda.\n\n🌟 The theme depicts the significance of water bodies in our life, and our deliberate attempt to not recognise its significance — leading to more water pollution.\n\n👉 THE MAA DURGA IDOL IS STUNNING!\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 1/2 https://t.co/jxy1HxFhiK https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109541619070599222"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109537915839889408", "3_2109537962837102592", "3_2109538006206218241", "3_2109538081422614528"]}, "author_id": "1154229504199385088", "created_at": "2026-10-12T06:54:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109538124703658350"], "id": "2109538124703658350", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 1218, "like_count": 100, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "Divine &amp; Dreamy 🎨  A breathtaking pandal that reflects the artistic brilliance, cultural richness, and creative imagination of Bengal’s talented artists. 🎨🙏\n\nChorebagan Sarbojanin, \nKolkata Durgapuja2026 \n\n#durgapuja2026 #kolkatadurgapuja #durgapuja #culture #photooftheday https://t.co/p0PAsInzcC", "url": "https://x.com/Caperspectives/status/2109538124703658350"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109527758665854976", "3_2109527771450134528"]}, "author_id": "2084548793731895296", "created_at": "2026-10-12T06:13:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109527792610374058"], "id": "2109527792610374058", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 3796, "like_count": 110, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Visited the 23 Palli Durga Temple in Harish Mukherjee Road, Kolkata. This beautiful temple where I go every year on the day of Mahalaya is directly opposite to Shantiniketan the house of TMC politician Abhishek Banerjee. https://t.co/gT7b3EOQPc", "url": "https://x.com/AhanaGhosh27197/status/2109527792610374058"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109349880020025344", "3_2109349892980371456"]}, "author_id": "1341576373672898561", "created_at": "2026-10-11T18:26:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109349903600374159"], "id": "2109349903600374159", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 17, "impression_count": 5839, "like_count": 340, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 26}, "text": "#2 Visited Didi @keyakahe's Durga Puja at Rajdanga Naba Uday Sangha. Unreal colour combination as theme. https://t.co/bC8Dev0wKx", "url": "https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2109349903600374159"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109296279683776512", "3_2109296296716906497"]}, "author_id": "1313326464461283328", "created_at": "2026-10-11T14:53:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109296330657153157"], "id": "2109296330657153157", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1075, "like_count": 69, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Pujo is not Pujo without the OG Rudranis. Both Durga idols for 2026, for College Square and Ekdalia Evergreen, are out and currently in their pandals for the final touches. Padma Shri Sanatan Rudra Pal's signature touch brings them alive every time. The best of sabekis ✨💫 PC https://t.co/ks35m9SRbR", "url": "https://x.com/horek_rokom/status/2109296330657153157"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109202485714034688", "3_2109202494312316929", "3_2109202502579335168", "3_2109202510808559616"]}, "author_id": "154897502", "created_at": "2026-10-11T08:40:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109202518408589657"], "id": "2109202518408589657", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "चोरबागान सार्वजनिन दुर्गा पूजा 2026 की पहली झलक! 😍❤️\n\nकोलकाता में पूजा की रौनक अब दिखने लगी है!  🙏🌺\n\nFirst look of Chorebagan Sarbojanin 2026! 😍\n\nPujo vibes are finally here! ❤️🪔\n\n.\n\n.\n\n.\n\n#ChorebaganSarbojanin #DurgaPuja2026 #pujovibes❤️ #kolkatadurgapuja #northkolkata https://t.co/YXHmy9the3", "url": "https://x.com/vinay873/status/2109202518408589657"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2108777184844525568"]}, "author_id": "1677414224094695424", "created_at": "2026-10-10T04:30:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2108777202666062331"], "id": "2108777202666062331", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 367, "like_count": 30, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Subho Mohaloya sobaike ❤️\n\nSobar Ebochor Pujo jeno bhalo kore katuk. \n\n📍Nalin Sarkar Street, 2025 https://t.co/FPKGBvQQi2", "url": "https://x.com/mohunbaganlad/status/2108777202666062331"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2108748963453022208"]}, "author_id": "3051747481", "created_at": "2026-10-10T02:38:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2108748966225469747"], "id": "2108748966225469747", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "College Square Durga Puja 2026 🔥 এবারের থিম কী? Club Member জানালেন আসল চমক | Full